  "about": "Where every app lives when it is not one of the most-used on page 1. bin/homescreen-propose fills page 1 automatically and builds state/proposed.json from this. A name places every app on the phone with that display name; anything named here that isn't installed is reported and ignored. This starter is generic — replace it (or have Claude draft one from state/current.json) with your own apps and folders.",
